OL,3,GNEWSAMan cautioned over Reform
OL,4,Aconference assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been given a caution by
OL,7,Fpolice as part of an investigation into
OL,8,Fassaults on protesters at the Reform UK
OL,9,Fparty conference in Birmingham earlier
OL,10,Fthis month.
OL,12,FFootage appeared to show protesters
OL,13,Fbeing manhandled by audience members as
OL,14,Fthey were thrown out. One woman had her
OL,15,Fhair pulled, and was was hit with a
OL,16,Fwalking stick.
OL,18,FWest Midlands Police said it was
OL,19,Finvestigating assaults on five people
OL,20,Fand two other men had been voluntarily
OL,21,Finterviewed, as inquiries continued.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
